# Copy to $MINDFORGE_STATE/rules.txt. One rotating nudge per line.
# `mindforge brief` surfaces one per day, rotating -- so a reminder stays
# visible without becoming wallpaper.
#
# A rule that must arrive in EVERY session does not belong here: one per day
# means any given line is absent most days, and the rotation prints only in
# the full brief, never in the injected handoff. Put those in always.txt --
# see always.example.
When a rule keeps breaking, change the design, not the reminder.
Write forward, then revise. Not both at once.
